    "name": "Queue Depth Report (24h → .github#29)",
    "description": "C5.5 (#40): once a day summarize metrics:queue-depth for the last 24 h and comment it on oneshotllc/.github#29 (C2 flat-queue evidence). Replaces the launchd report job.",
    "active": true,
